/-! ### §3.6 Case QJ: $\frac14\le x\le\frac12\le y\le1$, $x+y\ge1$ -/

/-- [DIRX], §3.6 (Case $QJ$): $G[B_{w_1}](x,y)\ge0$ for $\frac14\le x\le\frac12\le y\le1$,
$x+y\ge1$. -/
theorem caseQJ (x y : ℝ) (hx : x ∈ Icc (1 / 4 : ℝ) (1 / 2)) (hy : y ∈ Icc (1 / 2 : ℝ) 1)
    (hxy : 1 ≤ x + y) : G (B_{w₁}) x y ≥ 0 := by
